# Arena TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1, the user's config (expressive motion, Colloid, their 4 widgets).
# Each file runs top to bottom from a fresh desktop. `static NAME x y w h`: that region must not change
# from there until the next `shot`, `rec` or `look` (the no-reload blocks end with their last close).
# Right-clicks: `ptr ... down up` lines marked (right button) need the runner's right button.

look material
rec mdi-press 1.5 ptr move 970 1032 sleep 300 down sleep 400 up
note 52 px state layer 8 %→10 %; glyph swells ≈6 % and bounces on release
shot mdi-icons
note Downloads blue Colloid folder, Trash grey can
setup python3 -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('dock',{})['pinned']=json.loads('[\"foot\"]');json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 1.5
rec mdi-bounce 2 ptr move 951 1032 click
note hop 14.4 px twice: up 220 ms emphasized decelerate, down 260 ms OutBounce
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
setup python3 -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('dock',{})['pinned']=json.loads('[]');json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
